@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:Bob ex:knows ex:Alice .
<< ex:Bob ex:knows ex:Alice ~ ex:stmt1 >> ex:certainty "0.9" .

ex:System ex:validates <<( ex:Bob ex:knows ex:Alice )>> .
<< ex:System ex:validates <<( ex:Bob ex:knows ex:Alice )>> ~ ex:stmt2 >> ex:source "LogA" .